\":4,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/full-stack-developer-skills\/#faq-question-1786342930498\",\"name\":\"4. How long does it take to learn the full\u00a0stack\u00a0developer skills list?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"It usually takes around 4 to 6 months to cover the core full\u00a0stack\u00a0developer skills list through a focused course. The exact timeline depends on your dedication, practice, and prior exposure to coding.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/full-stack-developer-skills\/#faq-question-1786342945539\",\"position\":5,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/full-stack-developer-skills\/#faq-question-1786342945539\",\"name\":\"5. Which programming languages should a full-stack developer learn first?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Begin with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript for the front-end. After that, pick a back-end language like Python, PHP, Java, or Ruby. Mastering these forms\u00a0the\u00a0foundation of your full stack development\u00a0expertise.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/full-stack-developer-skills\/#faq-question-1786342965152\",\"position\":6,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/full-stack-developer-skills\/#faq-question-1786342965152\",\"name\":\"6. How much does a full-stack developer earn in India?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"According to Glassdoor, the average base pay ranges between INR 4L and 10 LPA. Actual packages vary based on company size, experience, location, and skill level.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/full-stack-developer-skills\/#faq-question-1786342980191\",\"position\":7,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubete